title: The Well of Ink
portrait left: seeker

In the center of a reading room you find a well, full to the top with ink. Nothing reflects in the ink, but something is turning it slowly. 

choice:
  - Dip a card into the ink (transform one card) -> transform
  - Drink the ink... (+6 max HP, and a Debt) -> drink
  - Back away- this can't be good.  -> leave

@transform
  > card transform choose 1
  The card comes out... different. The ink does not come off your hand.
  > end

@drink
  > maxhp 6
  > curse debt
  It tastes like copper and old paper. Your teeth are stained.
  > end

@leave
  The ink stops turning when you back away, and starts as soon as you turn around...
  > end
